  "body": "- #468 pointed out that the clock demos were kind of confused as to which filenames they were using. This is now fixed.\n- The blue robot demo was missing some files, and had a useless base URL. This fixes https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=28200.\n\nI am not sure why the index-idle.html for blue-robot exists. The difference appears to be that index-idl.html has some extra code related to animation?? Should we just remove it and change the source to point to index.html?\n\nDemos still have more issues; will update #30 with a list.\n",
